# Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Eyetwitch (1/1, flying). "When this creature dies, learn" (CR 701.48a): Bot1 discards
# Mountain (the one card that is not an Island) and draws the next card, Forest; because a card was discarded no Lesson may
# be brought in from outside, so the Lesson stays in the sideboard. Eyetwitch is in its owner's graveyard before the trigger.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Eyetwitch
Mountain
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Island x10

[Bot1 Sideboard]
Firebending Lesson

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eyetwitch.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Eyetwitch.Keywords = Flying
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Eyetwitch)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain; Eyetwitch
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Sideboard = Firebending Lesson
